==Battleground==
*4 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Great Angel Chibinel]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Take this stage seriously since Shadow Boxer Ks will tear through basic fodder, especially with support from Chibinel and Doge Dark spam. Bring a solid defense against Dark or a solid area attacker such as various Ubers or Beefcake Cat. Stay on top of taking down SBKs and try to keep Chibinel back whenever you can. Thunderbolt cannon buys valuable time here.

